# Sandgem Town, standing at the Pokemon Center door (the game's own fly spawn),
# early-game party, Poke Balls and a Poketch with three apps. Drives scenarios
# 2 (Route 201 grass: a wild battle and a catch), 3 (Center heal, Mart buy, PC
# box) and the Poketch half of 5.
#
# The story vars are moved past the three coordinate triggers on the way
# (Sandgem x=164 lab escort, Route 202 catching tutorial, Route 201 rival), so
# walking west into the grass meets wild Pokemon instead of a cutscene.
name GQ
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 27182
money 3000
var VAR_PLAYER_STARTER SPECIES_TURTWIG
var VAR_SANDGEM_TOWN_STATE 3
var VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 2
var VAR_FOLLOWER_RIVAL_STATE 4
party SPECIES_TURTWIG 9 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_TACKLE
party SPECIES_STARLY 6 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_POKE_BALL 10
item ITEM_POTION 2
poketch POKETCH_APPID_CALCULATOR
poketch POKETCH_APPID_MEMOPAD
poketch POKETCH_APPID_DIGITALWATCH
map MAP_HEADER_SANDGEM_TOWN 0xB1 0x34B FACE_DOWN
